// The main set, 13 minutes of the session: weak concepts first (at most
// plan_review_slots rows, the 70 percent), then new concepts fill what review left,
// up to plan_main_slots rows in all. The rows are dealt into their own session with
// a sort key each, ordered by key (round by round, the seed breaking ties) and only
// then added to the plan, so concepts interleave and one concept's items are not
// back to back unless it is the only concept there is.

